[
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h1",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [],
        "title": "Hint",
        "text": "By the hint, we know x-1>0, so x>1, and x**3-3*x-10>0",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://OATutor.io",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a27f94cexp9a-h1"
        ],
        "title": "LHS",
        "text": "$$b*(\\log_{c}\\left(a\\right))=\\log_{c}\\left(a^b\\right)$$, so log{7}{49}+3*(log{7}{x-1})-log{7}{x**3-3*x-10}=log{7}{49}+log{7}{(x-1)**3}-log{7}{x**3-3*x-10}",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://OATutor.io",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h3",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a27f94cexp9a-h2"
        ],
        "title": "LHS",
        "text": "Since $$\\log_{c}\\left(a b\\right)=\\log_{c}\\left(a\\right)+\\log_{c}\\left(b\\right)$$ and $$\\log_{c}\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)=\\log_{c}\\left(a\\right)-\\log_{c}\\left(b\\right)$$, so log{7}{49}+log{7}{(x-1)**3}-log{7}{x**3-3*x-10}=log{7}{(49*(x-1)**3)/(x**3-3*x-10)}",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://OATutor.io",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h4",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a27f94cexp9a-h3"
        ],
        "title": "$$LHS=RHS$$",
        "text": "For a>0, $$\\log_{c}\\left(a\\right)=b$$ implies $$a=c^b$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://OATutor.io",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h5",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a27f94cexp9a-h4"
        ],
        "title": "Simplification",
        "text": "log{7}{(49*(x-1)**3)/(x**3-3*x-10)}=2 is equivalent to (49*(x-1)**3)/(x**3-3*x-10)=7**2=49",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://OATutor.io",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h6",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": [
            "a27f94cexp9a-h5"
        ],
        "title": "Simplification",
        "text": "Divide by $$49$$ on both sides, we get ((x-1)**3)/(x**3-3*x-10)=1",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://OATutor.io",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
        "id": "a27f94cexp9a-h7",
